{"id": "q011", "type": "factual", "status": "answered", "reason": null, "answer": "Amazon\u2019s three reportable segments are:\n1. **North America** [c1]\n2. **International** [c1]\n3. **AWS (Amazon Web Services)** [c1]", "flags": [], "ungrounded": [], "citations": [{"type": "filing", "id": "c1", "chunk_id": 2421, "ticker": "AMZN", "company": "Amazon.com, Inc.", "fiscal_year": 2024, "section": "Item 8", "page": 65, "accession": "0001018724-25-000004", "label": "AMZN FY2024 10-K, Item 8, p.65"}], "tools": ["filing_search"], "tool_ok": [true], "n_steps": 2, "latency_s": 19.74, "tokens": 4786, "cost_usd": 0.000506, "models": ["gemini-3.5-flash-lite"], "sql_verdicts": []}
{"id": "q012", "type": "factual", "status": "answered", "reason": null, "answer": "Alphabet reports its business through two segments for Google\u2014**Google Services** and **Google Cloud**\u2014along with all non-Google businesses collectively referred to as **Other Bets** [c1]. \n\n* **Google Services:** Comprises products and platforms such as ads, Android, Chrome, hardware devices, Gmail, Google Drive, Google Maps, Google Photos, Google Play, Search, and YouTube [c3].\n* **Google Cloud:** Includes infrastructure and platform services, data analytics platforms, and collaboration tools (such as Google Workspace and Gemini for Google Cloud) [c5].\n* **Other Bets:** Includes earlier-stage and developing businesses outside of Google that are focused on solving big problems across various industries (such as healthcare and transportation, e.g., Waymo) [c5]. \n\nAdditionally, Alphabet maintains centralized AI-related research and development activities at the Alphabet level to support these businesses [c1].", "flags": [], "ungrounded": [], "citations": [{"type": "filing", "id": "c1", "chunk_id": 1482, "ticker": "GOOGL", "company": "Alphabet Inc.", "fiscal_year": 2024, "section": "Item 1", "page": 5, "accession": "0001652044-25-000014", "label": "GOOGL FY2024 10-K, Item 1, p.5"}, {"type": "filing", "id": "c3", "chunk_id": 1490, "ticker": "GOOGL", "company": "Alphabet Inc.", "fiscal_year": 2024, "section": "Item 1", "page": 7, "accession": "0001652044-25-000014", "label": "GOOGL FY2024 10-K, Item 1, p.7"}, {"type": "filing", "id": "c5", "chunk_id": 1496, "ticker": "GOOGL", "company": "Alphabet Inc.", "fiscal_year": 2024, "section": "Item 1", "page": 9, "accession": "0001652044-25-000014", "label": "GOOGL FY2024 10-K, Item 1, p.9"}], "tools": ["filing_search"], "tool_ok": [true], "n_steps": 2, "latency_s": 9.71, "tokens": 4403, "cost_usd": 0.000512, "models": ["gemini-3.5-flash-lite"], "sql_verdicts": []}
{"id": "q013", "type": "factual", "status": "answered", "reason": null, "answer": "JPMorgan Chase organizes its activities into three reportable business segments, along with a Corporate segment [c3]:\n\n1. **Consumer & Community Banking (CCB)** \u2013 The firm's consumer business segment [c1].\n2. **Commercial & Investment Bank (CIB)** \u2013 A wholesale business segment formed by combining the former Corporate & Investment Bank and Commercial Banking segments [c1, c4].\n3. **Asset & Wealth Management (AWM)** \u2013 A wholesale business segment [c1].\n4. **Corporate** \u2013 Encompasses remaining activities not included in the reportable business segments [c1].", "flags": [], "ungrounded": [], "citations": [{"type": "filing", "id": "c3", "chunk_id": 4225, "ticker": "JPM", "company": "JPMorgan Chase & Co.", "fiscal_year": 2025, "section": "Item 1", "page": 3, "accession": "0001628280-26-008131", "label": "JPM FY2025 10-K, Item 1, p.3"}, {"type": "filing", "id": "c1", "chunk_id": 6529, "ticker": "JPM", "company": "JPMorgan Chase & Co.", "fiscal_year": 2024, "section": "Item 1", "page": 3, "accession": "0000019617-25-000270", "label": "JPM FY2024 10-K, Item 1, p.3"}, {"type": "filing", "id": "c4", "chunk_id": 6528, "ticker": "JPM", "company": "JPMorgan Chase & Co.", "fiscal_year": 2024, "section": "Item 1", "page": 3, "accession": "0000019617-25-000270", "label": "JPM FY2024 10-K, Item 1, p.3"}], "tools": ["filing_search"], "tool_ok": [true], "n_steps": 2, "latency_s": 35.73, "tokens": 4467, "cost_usd": 0.0005, "models": ["gemini-3.5-flash-lite"], "sql_verdicts": []}
